Z||000004||JAMIE||02-17-2001||06:00 PM||||Tim Perrigo at Fiero Parts & Appraisals has 3 sets of the white splash guards left if anyone is interested.Yes, Lar is right , they would look fine on a white Fiero - but that probably is about the only colour Fiero on which they would look ok. Nice item for a collector though.||||reg||1
